msgid "legal.privacy_excerpt"
msgstr "We value your privacy. This Privacy Policy describes how ShopFront Inc. collects, uses, and shares information about you when you use our websites, mobile applications, and other online products and services or when you otherwise interact with us. By using our Services, you agree to the collection, use, disclosure, and procedures described in this Privacy Policy."

msgid "legal.cookie_notice"
msgstr ""
"This website uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience.\n"
"\n"
"Essential cookies: Required for basic site functionality.\n"
"Analytics cookies: Help us understand how visitors interact with the site.\n"
"Marketing cookies: Used to deliver relevant advertisements.\n"
"\n"
"You can manage your preferences at any time in Settings > Privacy."

